    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2486520336",
      "Source": "A mysterious implant found in the heart of the Hapipalus Queen. <#RN#><#RN#>It still hums of energy & sounds of a heart beat. I wonder if it still has a use...<#RN#><#RN#>-------!! rdeUn --------- -- ------------ ------ --- -------- ---- ---- ------- ---------- ----: --------------!!",
