    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3989436378",
      "Source": "Combine various Apex Drops to create this charm to summon the Hapipalus Queen Boss for a brutal challenge & huge rewards upon it's defeat.<#RN#><#RN#>WARNING: This Boss is meant to be twice as hard as Alpha Hapipalus Queen. Do not underestimate it. Only Summon if absolutely prepared.<#RN#><#RN#>Note: Crafting costs will change if you have the Arkology: New Encounters Variant Mod installed or not. (Change does not show in engram list)",
      "Trans": {"SC":"组合各种顶级掉落物来制作这个护符，以召唤沼卫龙女王 Boss，挑战残酷但击败后奖励丰厚。<#RN#><#RN#>警告：这个 Boss 的难度是精英沼卫龙女王的两倍。切勿低估。仅在完全准备好后召唤。<#RN#><#RN#>注意：若安装或未安装《Arkology: New Encounters Variant Mod》模组，制作成本会变化。（变化不会显示在印痕列表中）","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
